raph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p006","quote":"三十八年，北戎伐齊，齊使求救，鄭遣太子忽將兵救齊。齊釐公欲妻之，忽謝曰：「我小國，非齊敵也。」時祭仲與倶，勸使取之，曰：「君多内寵，太子無大援將不立，三公子皆君也。」所謂三公子者，太子忽，其弟突，次弟子亹也。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"太子忽，其弟突，次弟子亹","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示子、生育、母稱與兄弟來源主張；不把繼位獨自作父子，不補未知母名或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji042-014","subject_person_id":"gr5_u66_wkh","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p012","quote":"子亹元年七月，齊襄公會諸侯於首止，鄭子亹往會，髙渠彌相，從，祭仲稱疾不行。所以然者，子亹自齊襄公爲公子之時，嘗會鬬，相仇，及會諸侯，祭仲請子亹無行。子亹曰：「齊彊，而厲公居櫟，卽不往，是率諸侯伐我，内厲公。我不如往，往何遽必辱，且又何至是！」卒行。於是祭仲恐齊并殺之，故稱疾。子亹至，不謝齊侯，齊侯怒，遂伏甲而殺子亹。髙渠彌亡歸，歸與祭仲謀，召子亹弟公子嬰於陳而立之，是爲鄭子。是歳，齊襄公使彭生醉拉殺魯桓公。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子亹弟公子嬰","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示子、生育、母稱與兄弟來源主張；不把繼位獨自作父子，不補未知母名或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042