君也。」所謂三公子者，太子忽，其弟突，次弟子亹也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子忽","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"齊釐公","kind":"person","person_id":"81n_sfg_u64","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"忽","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0075","start":75,"end":78,"surface":"三公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"三公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"太子忽","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"突","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m006-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p011","text":"昭公二年，自昭公爲太子時，父莊公欲以髙渠彌爲卿，太子忽惡之，莊公弗聽，卒用渠彌爲卿。及昭公卽位，懼其殺己，冬十月辛卯，渠彌與昭公出獵，射殺昭公於野。祭仲與渠彌不敢入厲公，乃更立昭公弟子亹爲君，是爲子亹也，無謚號。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received